#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:5 abc8b99612c644d99be35d604ff58b77
msgid "RPLidar A1, A2, A2M12, C1 and S1 360 degree lidar"
msgstr "RPLidar A1、A2、A2M12、C1 和 S1 360度激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:7 d0f60c12293c434f84c478867744d0c0
msgid ""
"The `RPLidar C1 <https://www.slamtec.com/en/C1>`__, `RPLidar A1 "
"<https://www.slamtec.com/en/Lidar/A1>`__, `RPLidar A2 "
"<https://www.slamtec.com/en/Lidar/A2>`__, RPLidar A2M12, or RPlidar S1 can "
"be used for object avoidance in ArduPilot.  This page describes how to "
"connect them directly to your autopilot. See separate wiki pages on object "
"avoidance for Copter and Rover for more details on how to setup the "
"avoidance feature."
msgstr ""
"`RPLidar C1 <https://www.slamtec.com/en/C1>`__、`RPLidar A1 "
"<https://www.slamtec.com/en/Lidar/A1>`__、`RPLidar A2 "
"<https://www.slamtec.com/en/Lidar/A2>`__、RPLidar A2M12 或 RPlidar S1 可用于 "
"ArduPilot 的避障功能。本页介绍如何将它们直接连接到飞控。有关如何在 Copter 和 Rover 中设置避障功能的更多详情，请参阅各自的 "
"wiki 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:19 b1fe530b45a24ed4a2fc7e88d02f4121
msgid "*image courtesy of robotshop.com*"
msgstr "*图片由 robotshop.com 提供*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:22 6bc89ade6ba44b84b338071bd6194386
msgid "Where to buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:24 2dc44fdd063f482ba29a1c1d23974900
msgid ""
"Slamtec.com includes a `list of resellers here "
"<https://www.slamtec.com/en/Home/Buy>`__"
msgstr "Slamtec.com 提供了 `经销商列表 <https://www.slamtec.com/en/Home/Buy>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:27 ad7b7ef572d848139da0e96e9726d6c3
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:37 c24119c55cae4933bb843ca77e7d268a
msgid ""
"The lidar should be mounted horizontally on the top or bottom of the vehicle"
" with the black cable pointing towards the rear of the vehicle. Ensure the "
"sensor's view is not obstructed by any portion of the vehicle including GPS "
"mast, vehicle legs etc."
msgstr "激光雷达应水平安装在飞行器顶部或底部，黑色线缆朝向飞行器后方。确保传感器的视野不被飞行器任何部分（包括 GPS 杆、飞行器脚架等）遮挡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:40 a483e89992ab456f9103c1e79a9c28af
msgid ""
"The lidar can be connected to the autopilot's serial input as shown above. "
"Be sure that the autopilot's 5V supply is capable of supplying the unit's "
"required current. Otherwise provide an independent 5V supply to the unit."
msgstr "激光雷达可按上图所示连接到飞控的串行输入端。请确保飞控的5V电源能够为该设备提供所需的电流，否则请为该设备提供独立的5V电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:43 bb40bfe8b06948e5bd5260dcdc44632b
msgid ""
"Example setup below shown for first proximity sensor using SERIAL1 UART:"
msgstr "以下示例为使用SERIAL1 UART的第一个近距传感器的设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:45 54a45237fd204883845008aaa3a96107
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = \"11\" (\"Lidar360\")"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 「11」（「Lidar360」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:46 ab36ee53661d41d2b8731472ee3619f1
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = \"460800\" for C1, \"115\" for A2, "
"\"256\" for S1, A2M12"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = "
"「460800」适用于C1，「115」适用于A2，「256」适用于S1、A2M12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:47 a862ee17b07a42c69967b3bf717f3267
msgid ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = \"5\""
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 「5」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:48 66e29544e4014c3aa2ad7493da82ed33
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = \"0\" if mounted on the top of the "
"vehicle, \"1\" if mounted upside-down on the bottom of the vehicle."
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = 「0」，如果安装在飞行器顶部；「1」，如果倒置安装在飞行器底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:50 01843b0065b442a6bb751598944d5d57
msgid ""
"It may be necessary to turn off flow control if using Telem1 (aka Serial1) "
"or Telem2 (aka Serial2)"
msgstr "如果使用 Telem1（即 Serial1）或 Telem2（即 Serial2），可能需要关闭流控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:52 6b475a10eb294e9c88ccf9b432270cb5
msgid ":ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` =  \"0\" if using Serial1"
msgstr ":ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` = 「0」，如果使用 Serial1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:53 7258d0e9ed73422db9fbfae8c8f2ec77
msgid ":ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` =  \"0\" if using Serial2"
msgstr ":ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 「0」（使用Serial2时）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rplidar-a2.rst:55 19f75b054f4a44deac4634f2d6f8ee68
msgid ""
"More details on using this sensor for object avoidance on Copter can be "
"found :ref:`here <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"有关在 Copter 上使用此传感器进行避障的更多详情，请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`。"
